urname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Sullivan</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Linial</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence that the human foamy virus genome is DNA</article-title><source>J Virol</source><year>1999</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>1565</fpage><lpage>1572</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Virol||73|1565||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9882362</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yuan</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Miley</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Waters</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A quantification of human cells using an ERV-3 real time PCR assay</article-title><source>J Virol Methods</source><year>2001</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>109</fpage><lpage>117</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Virol Methods||91|109||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11164492</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>